  EVT -. event evidence .-> AUD
  INTEG -. provider operation evidence .-> AUD
  SEC -. control obligations .-> PLY
  SEC -. control evidence requirements .-> AUD

  %% Architectural invariants
  I1["No shared database or cross-domain writes"]:::external
  I2["External provider semantics remain behind the ACL"]:::external
  I3["Governance decisions fail closed"]:::external
  I4["AI recommendations require owning-domain acceptance"]:::external

  I1 -. constrains .-> COM
  I2 -. constrains .-> INTEG
  I3 -. constrains .-> GOV
  I4 -. constrains .-> INT
